tallCavityNu.rea
-3                     spatial dimension
1                     number of fields
#========================================================
#
#    Tall cavity, natural convection + radiation-convection
#    coupling, reproducing Yuan et al. Sec 4.3. Aspect ratio
#    H/D=20: gap D=1m (x), height H=20m (z), thin depth W=0.25m
#    (y, front/back = symmetry planes, not physical walls).
#
#    Boundary IDs: 1=hot wall (x=0, constant applied heat flux
#    fh=0.5 W/m^2, MINUS net radiative loss, via udfNeumann),
#    2=cold wall (x=1, fixed T=100K, udfDirichlet), 3=top (z=20,
#    "adiabatic" reradiating wall: zero APPLIED flux but still
#    radiatively active, via udfNeumann), 4=bottom (z=0, same as
#    top), 5=front/back (y=0,y=0.25, symmetry planes -- not real
#    walls, not radiating).
#
#    Numeric BC labels: an explicit boundaryTypeMap on
#    [FLUID VELOCITY]/[SCALAR TEMPERATURE] disables nekRS's
#    CBC-label auto-import of boundary IDs, so genbox needs to
#    write the IDs directly (see tallCavityNu.usr).
#
#========================================================
#
Box
-6 -2 -30          nelx,nely,nelz for Box
0 1 1               x0 x1 ratio
0 0.25 1               y0 y1 ratio
0 20 1               z0 z1 ratio
1  ,2  ,5  ,5  ,4  ,3     BCs (3 characters each!)
